  "description": "Part of the Axiom family. The LDB class mapper: [LdbEntity] classes whose schema, reads and writes a source generator writes at compile time, a unit of work with an identity map and change tracking, links between entities, and typed queries; no reflection over properties, Native AOT safe.",
  "iconFile": "Icon.png",
