  "published": "2026-11-08T16:28:43.907Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Names in code: each entity has a TableName constant and, for its many-to-many links, JoinTables.<Link> constants; each [LdbDatabase] class has a Name constant. A class with several [LinkMany] to one class gets a join table per link (its table and the property: GameWhiteTeam) instead of build error LDB1010, and the other side follows a link with [LinkMany(Through = nameof(Game.WhiteTeam))]. An LDB attribute argument the generator cannot read, such as a constant it writes itself, is build error LDB1014 (LDB2014 for migrations) instead of being taken as missing. A project with Axiom.LDB.Migration and no migration yet builds without LDB2001; a strict build still wants the model fixed (LDB2012). Members the generator adds (TableName, JoinTables; Name, Model, Migrations and the open and migrate methods of a database class) are reserved.",
